  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Max, we need to talk seriously!' The phrase meaning \"to us it's necessary\", is the casual \"we must\", a cousin of the standard word for necessary. The adverb form of serious is used here. Vika has had enough waiting.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Привет, Вика! Рад тебя видеть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Привет",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
