  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Hey, Vika! Glad to see you.' The first word supplies the casual hello. The descriptive Notice the part 'glad' ends bare because Max is a man; a woman would add a she-word ending. His smile is as false as the greeting.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ой, Костя звонит, извини!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ой",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Костя",
   "gap": 0.25
