   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Hard to hear, I will come over right now!' The phrase literally meaning \"badly audible\" is what is said for \"I can hardly hear\". The final action word is the come-over word previously used with Kostya. Max edges toward the door.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vika",
   "t": "Макс, подожди, не уходи!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "vika",
   "t": "Макс",
