   "t": "уходи",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Max, wait, do not leave!' The last two words mean \"don't go away\": the starting bit on the front means \"away\". Its opposite starting bit means \"towards\", so the action words mean leave and arrive respectively. Vika isn't fooled.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Вика, это очень срочное дело!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
