   "t": "дело",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Vika, this is a very urgent matter!' The last two words translate to \"urgent matter\": the descriptive word is from the first episode scenes, and the thing word from the phrase meaning \"what's the matter\". The descriptive word ends with a it-word ending bit to match the thing word.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
