  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'What do you mean, I did not call you.' The opening phrase, literally \"in the sense\", is the casual expression for \"what do you mean\". The rest of the sentence is structured as \"I to you didn't ring\": you ring \"to\" someone.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Сделай вид, что нужна помощь!",
