  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Pretend that you need help!' The language uses a phrase meaning \"make a look\", for \"pretend\". The thing We hear 'help' is she-word, so We hear 'needed' takes a she-word ending. Max whispers it.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
