  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Oh, you are hiding from Vika?' The action word means \"you hide yourself\", related to the word used in the hide-and-seek game. The phrase at the end is \"from Vika\": after the connecting word, her name takes a different ending.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
