  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " 'Yes, play along with me, please!' The action Notice the part 'play along', is the action word \"play\", with a starting bit meaning \"under\": play under me, back me up. The pointing word translates to \"to me\".",
   "gap": 0.4
